  "observations": {
    "M1": "Wide bridge/environment photograph with right dark information pocket; selected practical copy is larger. Initial preparation line visibly reads 돗자마 지참; selected reads 돗자리 지참. Warm light and blue evening are coherent, while image editing makes projected-film detail more painterly; finishing and AI-slop quality remain independently judged.",
    "M2": "Oblique overhead U of seated adults surrounds large central date/time. Upper and bottom corner groups differ from M1. Selected replaces heavily textured paving with flatter planes and larger foreground adults. Practical copy remains in corners; smooth figurative rendering requires a quality judgment rather than an authorship assertion.",
    "M3": "Continuous horizontal arrival/unfolding mat, watching screen and microphone conversation frieze with split top/bottom information. Selected shifts detailed scenic illustration to fewer black/red flat forms; this is an expression change, not merely cleaner typography.",
    "M4": "Large edge-cropped faces and microphone frame a cream central information corridor. Selected changes photographic expression into high-contrast ink illustration, preserves the programme in a soft two-line wrap and enlarges practical details. Central column density and uniform weight remain review questions.",
    "M5": "Architecture carries left stacked title, upper schedule lintel and right practical pier around cinema scene. Selected practical column is wider, with explicit wraps for venue/capacity/weather. Large blue structure and warm scene persist; selected still contains depth and figurative scenic detail rather than a wholly frontal flat abstraction."
  },
  "whole_set": "First sight, image boundaries and useful-information locations vary across all five. Closest figurative scene families M2/M5 have different U/date-centred versus architectural enclosure grammar. Type weight is broadly heavy across the set and is retained as an independent quality/diversity question.",
